    "%@ has %@." : {
      "comment" : "Second sentence of a position difference found by Compare Libraries. %1$@ is a copy of the library, capitalized, and %2$@ is the place it has saved, such as \"chapter 3, 41%\".\nSentence of Use This Library's account when neither copy is newer. %1$@ is a copy of the library, capitalized, and %2$@ lists what only it has, such as \"newer places in 3 books and 2 books the other lacks\".",
