            "value" : "Libri importati"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Books can be moved only in a folder sorted by %@, and this folder is not." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the announcement when Move Book Up or Move Book Down is used in a folder that is not in manual order. %@ is the name of the Manual Order sort.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Los libros solo se pueden mover en una carpeta ordenada por %@, y esta no lo está."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Books can't be added while the library is moving." : {
      "comment" : "What a Library window says when a command that adds a book is chosen while the library is being moved.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pueden agregar libros mientras se mueve la biblioteca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Books can't be added while the library isn't available." : {
      "comment" : "What the Library window says when a command that adds a book is chosen while the library can't be used.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pueden agregar libros mientras la biblioteca no está disponible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Books can't be moved in this view. Go to a folder in Folders, or to the Reading List, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver announcement when Move Book Up or Move Book Down is used in a view that mixes books from many folders. Folders and Reading List are names of views in the View menu.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Los libros no se pueden mover en esta vista. Ve a una carpeta en Carpetas, o a la Lista de lectura, e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Books can't be opened while the library is moving." : {
      "comment" : "What a Library window says when a command that opens a book is chosen while the library is being moved.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pueden abrir libros mientras se mueve la biblioteca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Books can't be opened while the library isn't available." : {
      "comment" : "What the Library window says when a command that opens a book is chosen while the library can't be used.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pueden abrir libros mientras la biblioteca no está disponible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Books stay on this Mac until you remove their downloads or macOS needs space." : {
