    "Date Added" : {
      "comment" : "Name of a way to sort the books: by the date the book was added. Shown in the Sort menu, the library view editor, the window title, and in sort announcements.\nText of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. A kind of test as a condition's test pop-up names it. This is the case .addedWithin.",
