    "Go To" : {
      "comment" : "A command on a bookmark of the Bookmarks list, as a VoiceOver action and a context menu item: moves the book to the bookmark.\nButton of a marker's or a pause's row in the audio editor's list that moves the cursor there.\nLabel of the iPhone reader's button that opens the Go To sheet, and that sheet's title.\nName of a heading row's command that goes to the heading, as a VoiceOver action and a context menu item.",
