          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Contiene %1$@; library.json contiene %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It holds %@; the index holds %@." : {
      "comment" : "What a conflicting copy of a feed's index holds, set against the index itself. %1$@ and %2$@ are counts of episodes, such as \"12 episodes\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "It holds %1$@; the index holds %2$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Contiene %1$@; el índice contiene %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It holds no files." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of the alert about an archive or folder that holds no book: it holds no files at all.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No contiene archivos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It holds the feed “%@” with %@." : {
      "comment" : "What a conflicting copy of a feed's record holds. %1$@ is the feed's title; %2$@ is a count of items, such as \"12 items\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "It holds the feed “%1$@” with %2$@."
