    },
    "It holds the folders of the feeds %@." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of the dialog that asks how to delete a folder that holds several feeds' folders. %@ is a list of the feeds' titles in quotation marks.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Contiene las carpetas de los canales %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It holds the record of “%@”: %@." : {
      "comment" : "What a conflicting copy of a book's record holds. %1$@ is the book's title; %2$@ is the record's place and bookmarks, such as \"chapter 3, saved Nov 18, 2026, and 2 bookmarks\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
