            "value" : "No se pudo ejecutar el OCR en la única página del PDF, así que falta el texto que solo aparece en sus imágenes: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OK" : {
      "comment" : "Button that closes a notice.\nButton that closes an alert and changes nothing.\nButton that closes an alert that only informs. Title case.\nButton that dismisses an alert about a problem.\nButton that dismisses an alert after reading it.\nButton that dismisses an alert, here the one that tells TextMouth quit to protect the Mac.\nButton that dismisses the reader's error alert.\nTitle of the button that dismisses the alert telling the result of importing or exporting pronunciation rules.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Of each feed's episodes and articles, lists only the one you opened last." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. Its hint.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "De los episodios y artículos de cada canal, muestra solo el que abriste por última vez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off" : {
      "comment" : "The word for a setting that is turned off, as a slider's or stepper's value says it, such as the sleep timer's fade out.\nVoiceOver value of the iPhone reader's Sleep Timer button while no sleep timer runs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Desactivado"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Offer to transcribe after importing an audiobook" : {
      "comment" : "Label of the checkbox in Playback settings that makes TextMouth ask about transcribing after each audiobook is imported.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ofrecer transcribir después de importar un audiolibro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ogg" : {
      "comment" : "The name of the Ogg container format. Inside sentences about importing a file of that format.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ogg"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One Unit for Both Directions" : {
      "comment" : "A choice of the playback bar's navigation unit menus setting: one shared menu sets the unit of both skip buttons.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Una unidad para ambas direcciones"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One copy is played from a recording and the other is read aloud from text, so replacing keeps only the existing copy's folder and place on the reading list, not its reading position, bookmarks and their notes, or settings." : {
      "comment" : "Part of the question asked about a duplicate where one copy is an audiobook played from a recording and the other is read aloud from text: what Replace Existing keeps of the library's copy. \"The existing copy\" is the library's copy.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Una copia se reproduce desde una grabación y la otra se lee en voz alta desde texto, así que reemplazar solo conserva la carpeta y el lugar en la lista de lectura de la copia existente, no su posición de lectura, ni sus marcadores y sus notas, ni sus ajustes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One document in this file has too much markup for TextMouth to read in memory." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why a file was refused: one of its documents has so much markup that reading it would take too much memory.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Un documento de este archivo tiene demasiado marcado para que TextMouth lo lea en memoria."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One tag in this file has more than %@ attributes, which TextMouth can't read safely." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why a file was refused: one of its markup tags has more attributes than TextMouth reads. %@ is the most attributes, a number.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Una etiqueta de este archivo tiene más de %@ atributos, y TextMouth no puede leerla de forma segura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only a book that clearly shows English Braille, American Edition changes, when added. Book Information says the code was guessed and can choose another." : {
      "comment" : "The caption under the guess switch in the Braille tab of Settings. English Braille, American Edition is the name of a braille code, and Book Information is a window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Solo cambia, al agregarlo, un libro que muestra con claridad English Braille, American Edition. Información del libro indica que el código se adivinó y permite elegir otro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only an audiobook's audio can be edited." : {
      "comment" : "Said when Edit Audio… is chosen for something that is not an audiobook kept in a package of its own.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Solo se puede editar el audio de un audiolibro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only an episode or article downloaded in its feed can move into the library." : {
      "comment" : "Why Move to Library did nothing: none of the chosen items is an episode or article downloaded in its feed. Follows \"Could not move to the library: \".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Solo un episodio o artículo descargado en su canal se puede mover a la biblioteca."
          }
