    "Page %@" : {
      "comment" : "Announcement on reaching a page of a book that has pages, and the start of a sentence naming a page. %@ is the page's label as the book names it, such as 13 or xii, an identifier written without digit grouping.\nTitle of the chapter of one page of a book of pictures, made at import. %@ is the page's number, an identifier written without digit grouping.",
