    "Pause" : {
      "comment" : "Label of the button that pauses the book while it is playing.\nLabel of the reader's play and pause button while the book plays; it pauses.\nName of a key of the keyboard, spoken by VoiceOver and shown in braille in a keyboard shortcut such as \"Command + Pause\".\nName of the Pause media event, a choice for one step of the media-key pattern that starts a sleep timer in Settings.\nName of the playback event whose sound is chosen in Settings, Sound Effects: playing pauses.\nTitle of the button in the Record window that pauses the recording.",
