            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se detuvo después de %1$@ de %2$@:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped downloading “%@”." : {
      "comment" : "What VoiceOver says once Cancel Download stopped a download. %@ is the episode's or article's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se detuvo la descarga de “%@”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped keeping %@ on this Mac" : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when Stop Keeping on This Mac ran. %@ is the book's title, or a count of books such as \"3 books\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se dejó de mantener %@ en esta Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopped. Back at %@." : {
      "comment" : "Said as the audio editor's Stop goes back to where playing began. %@ is that time in words.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Detenido. De vuelta en %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stopping the library move before quitting." : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when TextMouth is asked to quit during a move of the library.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Deteniendo el traslado de la biblioteca antes de salir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops checking; the feed and its downloads stay" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the Unsubscribe button in Feed Info when it acts at once.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Deja de revisar; el canal y sus descargas se quedan"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops comparing. Nothing in either copy has been changed." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the Stop button of the Compare Libraries sheet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Detiene la comparación. No se ha cambiado nada en ninguna de las copias."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops every feed download, including those waiting, and deletes what they had downloaded." : {
      "comment" : "What VoiceOver says the feed downloads section's Cancel button does: it stops every feed download and deletes what they had downloaded.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Detiene todas las descargas de canales, incluidas las que esperan, y elimina lo que habían descargado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops moving the library. The library stays where it is, and nothing is changed." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the button that cancels the move of the library.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Detiene el traslado de la biblioteca. La biblioteca queda donde está y no se cambia nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops playback resuming when headphones disconnect" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the Enable Bluetooth monitoring switch in the Miscellaneous settings.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Evita que la reproducción se reanude cuando se desconectan los audífonos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops playing, and goes back to where playing began." : {
      "comment" : "Hint of the audio editor's Stop button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Detiene la reproducción y vuelve a donde empezó."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops recording and saves it in your library as an audiobook." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the Stop button in the Record window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Detiene la grabación y la guarda en tu biblioteca como audiolibro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops saying the code was guessed. The book is not read again." : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Deja de decir que el código fue deducido. El libro no se vuelve a leer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops the download. Nothing is installed." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the Cancel Download button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Detiene la descarga. No se instala nada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops the export and keeps the chapters already spoken until TextMouth quits, a different spoken audio export starts, or the book's voice, text, substitutions, or pauses change. Exporting the same range at the same speed and pitch goes on from them." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the Stop button in the Export dialog while a spoken audio export runs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Detiene la exportación y conserva los capítulos ya leídos hasta que TextMouth se cierre, comience otra exportación de audio hablado, o cambien la voz, el texto, las sustituciones o las pausas del libro. Si exportas el mismo intervalo con la misma velocidad y el mismo tono, continúa desde ellos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops the export. The file being made is not kept." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the Stop button in the Export dialog.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Detiene la exportación. El archivo que se estaba creando no se conserva."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops the import under way and those waiting. Books already imported stay." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the import overlay's Cancel button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Detiene la importación en curso y las que esperan. Los libros ya importados se quedan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops the search, keeping the matches found so far" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the Stop button of the Search Library window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Detiene la búsqueda y conserva las coincidencias encontradas hasta ahora"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stops the whole export. Files already written stay." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the Cancel Export button in the alert an export shows when a chapter nests too deeply.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Detiene toda la exportación. Los archivos ya escritos se conservan."
          }
