            "value" : "El libro se mantiene en esta Mac y está en la lista de lectura, que esta Mac mantiene descargada, así que no se puede quitar su descarga."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book is kept on this Mac, so its download can't be removed." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why Remove Download was refused: the listener chose Keep on This Mac for the book.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El libro se mantiene en esta Mac, así que no se puede quitar su descarga."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book is no longer in the library, so it was not read again." : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. Why a book that left the library while its Book Information was open is not read again.",
      "localizations" : {
