          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book's audio: its file, or its tracks in a folder named after the book, each named for its chapter." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the Audio checkbox in the Export dialog.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El audio del libro: su archivo, o sus pistas en una carpeta con el nombre del libro, cada una con el nombre de su capítulo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book's file as imported; for an audiobook, its audio files before TextMouth converted them." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the Original file checkbox in the Export dialog.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El archivo del libro tal como se importó; en un audiolibro, sus archivos de audio antes de que TextMouth los convirtiera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book's files aren't on this Mac yet. %@ may still be syncing them." : {
      "comment" : "Why a book can't be used yet: its files have not arrived. %@ is the cloud service's name, or \"The cloud service\" when it is unknown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Los archivos del libro aún no están en esta Mac. Puede que %@ todavía los esté sincronizando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book's headings changed after the dialog opened. Reopen it and choose the range again." : {
      "comment" : "Why a spoken audio export was refused: the book's headings changed after the Export dialog opened.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Los encabezados del libro cambiaron después de abrir el diálogo. Ábrelo de nuevo y vuelve a elegir el intervalo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book's navigation does not match its audio; get a fresh copy and import it again." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of an import failure: a section of a segmented audiobook does not fit the audio file it names, so the book's navigation (its manifest or headings) does not match its audio.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La navegación del libro no coincide con su audio; consigue una copia nueva e impórtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book's package and content paths do not match a managed library location." : {
      "comment" : "Why a book's files were not deleted: its paths do not lie inside the library. Follows \"Import failed: \".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Las rutas del paquete y del contenido del libro no coinciden con una ubicación administrada de la biblioteca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book's text as %@, made from its Markdown." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of a text checkbox in the Export dialog while its text is converted. %@ is the name of the format, such as HTML or RTF.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
