            "value" : "El archivo supera el límite de %lld MB para una transcripción."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file isn't a %@ transcript TextMouth can read." : {
      "comment" : "Error shown when a chosen transcript file's content is not in the format its name says. %@ is the format's name, such as WebVTT, SubRip, or Podcasting 2.0 JSON.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El archivo no es una transcripción %@ que TextMouth pueda leer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file itself has not been changed." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the library index recovery sheet when no copy of the unreadable file was saved.",
