          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La transcripción llega hasta %1$@, más allá del final del audio en %2$@, así que es de otro audio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transcript's files could not be examined once they were written." : {
      "comment" : "Error shown when TextMouth could not check the audio files after writing a transcript for them.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudieron examinar los archivos de la transcripción una vez escritos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transcript's text as %@, made from its Markdown." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the Transcript checkbox in the Export dialog while its text is written by a text writer. %@ is the writer's name, such as HTML or RTF.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El texto de la transcripción como %@, creado a partir de su Markdown."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transcript's text didn't read back as one chapter per chapter of the book." : {
      "comment" : "Error shown when the text written from a transcript did not have one chapter for each chapter of the audiobook.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El texto de la transcripción no se leyó de vuelta como un capítulo por cada capítulo del libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transcript's times don't fit together, so TextMouth can't use it." : {
      "comment" : "Error shown when an attached transcript file's times are out of order or inconsistent.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Los tiempos de la transcripción no encajan entre sí, así que TextMouth no puede usarla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transcript, with its text as Markdown for an audiobook." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the Transcript checkbox in the Export dialog.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La transcripción, con su texto como Markdown para un audiolibro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The transcript, with your changes, stays with the episode in its feed, even after its download is deleted. Deleting the episode or feed deletes it; Move to Library keeps it as a book." : {
      "comment" : "Note under a podcast episode's transcript editor and cleanup sheet. Move to Library is the name of a command in the feed's episode menu.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La transcripción, con tus cambios, se queda con el episodio en su canal, incluso después de eliminar su descarga. Eliminar el episodio o el canal la elimina; Mover a la biblioteca la conserva como libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The unreadable library index is no longer there, so TextMouth saved the library rebuilt from your books as the new index, with %@." : {
      "comment" : "Outcome of the library index recovery when the unreadable index had gone and the rebuilt library was saved as the new index. %@ is a count of books, such as \"743 books\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El índice ilegible de la biblioteca ya no está, así que TextMouth guardó como índice nuevo la biblioteca reconstruida a partir de tus libros, con %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The view is first in the list." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). Move Up's hint while the view is first, when it is dimmed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La vista es la primera de la lista."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The view is last in the list." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). Move Down's hint while the view is last, when it is dimmed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La vista es la última de la lista."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The view this window showed was deleted. It now shows %@." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library window's View pop-up and Go to View. What a window announces when the view it showed was deleted, from Settings or by a change of config.json, and it shows name, the first view its pop-up offers, instead. Placeholders in order: name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La vista que mostraba esta ventana se eliminó. Ahora muestra %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice changed its kind of audio partway through “%@”." : {
      "comment" : "Why a chapter of a spoken audio export could not be spoken: the voice changed its audio format. %@ is the chapter's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La voz cambió su tipo de audio a mitad de «%@»."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice made no sound for “%@”. Check that it speaks the book's language." : {
      "comment" : "Why a chapter of a spoken audio export could not be spoken: the voice made no sound. %@ is the chapter's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La voz no emitió ningún sonido para «%@». Comprueba que hable el idioma del libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The voice stopped partway through “%@”, and TextMouth stopped waiting." : {
      "comment" : "Why a chapter of a spoken audio export could not be spoken: the voice stalled. %@ is the chapter's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La voz se detuvo a mitad de «%@», y TextMouth dejó de esperar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The words TextMouth reads aloud, as plain text, each chapter under its title." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the Text as plain text checkbox in the Export dialog.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Las palabras que TextMouth lee en voz alta, como texto sin formato, con cada capítulo bajo su título."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their %@ are kept." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence that says what is kept of every one of several deleted downloads. %@ is a list of parts, such as \"places and bookmarks\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Sus %@ se conservan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their original files were not changed." : {
      "comment" : "Second sentence of the alert about several books that could not move into the current library format.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Sus archivos originales no se modificaron."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their places, bookmarks, and transcripts, if they have any, are kept, and they can be downloaded again." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence about several deleted downloads: what the listener left in them is kept, and they can be downloaded again.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Sus lugares, marcadores y transcripciones, si los tienen, se conservan, y se pueden descargar de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then take it off the reading list, or clear %@ in the Reading List's options." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of why Remove Download was refused for a book the listener keeps and the reading list keeps too: what to do after choosing Stop Keeping on This Mac. %@ is the name of the Reading List's option that keeps its books downloaded, as the option shows it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Luego quítalo de la lista de lectura, o desactiva %@ en las opciones de la lista de lectura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no feeds to refresh." : {
      "comment" : "What VoiceOver says when Refresh All Feeds finds no feed in the library.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No hay canales que actualizar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no subscriptions to export." : {
      "comment" : "What Export OPML says when the library has no feed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No hay suscripciones que exportar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There are no subscriptions to export: every feed in your library is unsubscribed." : {
      "comment" : "What Export OPML says when every feed in the library is unsubscribed, which an export leaves out.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No hay suscripciones que exportar: todos los canales de tu biblioteca tienen la suscripción cancelada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is a file at %@, not a folder." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why the chosen location can't be used: a file is there. %@ is the path.\nWhy the library can't be used: a file sits where the library's folder should be. %@ is the path.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Hay un archivo en %@, no una carpeta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no page %@ in this book." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the message when Go to Page is given a page the book does not have. %@ is what the user typed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No hay ninguna página %@ en este libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is no view %@. Go to View reaches %lld views." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver announcement when a Go to View key has no view. %1$@ is the view's number as the listener pressed it, an identifier written without digit grouping. %2$lld is how many views Go to View reaches, a count.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "There is no view %@. Go to View reaches %lld view."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "There is no view %@. Go to View reaches %lld views."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "many" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "No hay vista %1$@. Ir a vista llega a %2$lld de vistas."
                }
              },
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "No hay vista %1$@. Ir a vista llega a %2$lld vista."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "No hay vista %1$@. Ir a vista llega a %2$lld vistas."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is not enough free disk space to convert %@: it needs %@ free." : {
      "comment" : "Why an audio conversion did not start: the disk holds too little free space. %1$@ is the source file's name and %2$@ the free space it needs, with its unit, such as \"1.2 GB\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "There is not enough free disk space to convert %1$@: it needs %2$@ free."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No hay suficiente espacio libre en el disco para convertir %1$@: necesita %2$@ libres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There is nothing to export." : {
      "comment" : "Shown in the Export dialog when the books hold nothing to export.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No hay nada que exportar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn't enough free space for %lld more books" : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when some reading list books start downloading and others are left out for want of space. %lld is the number of books left out.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "There isn't enough free space for %lld more book"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "There isn't enough free space for %lld more books"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "many" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "No hay suficiente espacio libre para %lld de libros más"
                }
              },
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "No hay suficiente espacio libre para %lld libro más"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "No hay suficiente espacio libre para %lld libros más"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn't enough free space for the library there: it needs %@, and %@ is free." : {
      "comment" : "Why the chosen location can't be used: the disk is too full. %1$@ is the size the library needs, such as \"5.5 GB\"; %2$@ is the free space.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "There isn't enough free space for the library there: it needs %1$@, and %2$@ is free."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No hay suficiente espacio libre para la biblioteca allí: necesita %1$@, y hay %2$@ libres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn't enough free space to download %lld reading list books" : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when no reading list book can start downloading for want of space. %lld is the number of books left out.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "There isn't enough free space to download %lld reading list book"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "There isn't enough free space to download %lld reading list books"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "many" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "No hay suficiente espacio libre para descargar %lld de libros de la lista de lectura"
                }
              },
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "No hay suficiente espacio libre para descargar %lld libro de la lista de lectura"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "No hay suficiente espacio libre para descargar %lld libros de la lista de lectura"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn't room on this Mac for this episode (%@)." : {
      "comment" : "Why a feed's episode could not be downloaded: the disk is too full. %@ is the file's size with its unit, such as 61 MB.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No hay espacio en esta Mac para este episodio (%@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There isn’t enough free space on the disk." : {
      "comment" : "Why an import failed when the disk is full. Said instead of the system's own sentence, which names a hidden internal file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No hay suficiente espacio libre en el disco."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's an empty filter between two commas." : {
      "comment" : "Problem found in a typed filter chain (the audio editor's Apply Filter and the filter presets): two commas in a row leave a filter with nothing in it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Hay un filtro vacío entre dos comas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's no audio after the cursor to preview." : {
      "comment" : "Said when the audio editor has no audio after the cursor to preview a filter on.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No hay audio después del cursor para previsualizar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's no feed at that address any more." : {
      "comment" : "Why a feed could not be fetched: the address answers that nothing is there (error 404).",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ya no hay ningún canal en esa dirección."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's no library in %@ to use, and none to move there while the library isn't available." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why the chosen folder can't be used: it holds no library and there is none to move. %@ is the folder's path.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No hay ninguna biblioteca en %@ que usar, ni ninguna que trasladar allí mientras la biblioteca no está disponible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's nothing to redo." : {
      "comment" : "Said by the audio editor's Redo when nothing has been undone.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No hay nada que rehacer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There's nothing to undo." : {
      "comment" : "Said when Undo is asked for and there is no edit to undo, and the hint of a dimmed Undo in the audio editor.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No hay nada que deshacer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These books could not be deleted and remain in the library:" : {
      "comment" : "Heading over the books that could not be deleted permanently, several of them. One line for each book follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Estos libros no se pudieron eliminar y permanecen en la biblioteca:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These books could not be moved to the Trash and remain in the library:" : {
      "comment" : "Heading over the books that could not be moved to the Trash, several of them. One line for each book follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Estos libros no se pudieron mover a la Papelera y permanecen en la biblioteca:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These books could not be removed from the library and remain in it:" : {
      "comment" : "Heading of the error alert's list when Remove from Library Only could not mark the packages of several books, so they stay in the library. Each book's title and the reason follow on their own lines.\nHeading over the books that could not be removed from the library, several of them. One line for each book follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Estos libros no se pudieron quitar de la biblioteca y permanecen en ella:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These books were removed from the library, but their bookInfo.json files could not be deleted. They stay out of the library:" : {
      "comment" : "Heading of the error alert's list when Remove from Library Only removed several books but could not delete the bookInfo.json files in their packages. bookInfo.json is a file name. Each book's title and the reason follow on their own lines.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Estos libros se quitaron de la biblioteca, pero no se pudieron eliminar sus archivos bookInfo.json. Siguen fuera de la biblioteca:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These edits need the original audio, which is no longer kept." : {
      "comment" : "Said when the edits wait to be rendered from an original audio that is gone. A second sentence says what helps.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Estas ediciones necesitan el audio original, que ya no se conserva."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These items could not be deleted and remain in the library:" : {
      "comment" : "Heading over the items of a folder that could not be deleted permanently, several of them. One line for each follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Estos elementos no se pudieron eliminar y permanecen en la biblioteca:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These items could not be moved to the Trash and remain in the library:" : {
      "comment" : "Heading over the items of a folder that could not be moved to the Trash, several of them. One line for each follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Estos elementos no se pudieron mover a la Papelera y permanecen en la biblioteca:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These items could not be removed from the library and remain in it:" : {
      "comment" : "Heading over the items of a folder that could not be removed from the library, several of them. One line for each follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Estos elementos no se pudieron quitar de la biblioteca y permanecen en ella:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These transcript files beside the audio weren't attached: %@. The debug log says why." : {
      "comment" : "Notice after an import: several transcript files found beside the audio were not attached. %@ is their names as a list, such as \"“03.vtt”, “07.vtt”, and “09.srt”\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Estos archivos de transcripción junto al audio no se adjuntaron: %@. El registro de depuración explica por qué."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They are listed after the differences." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of the results of Compare Libraries that follows the count of unread files: the files are listed after the differences.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se enumeran después de las diferencias."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They stay in %@" : {
      "comment" : "Announcement after Remove Download removed several books' files from this Mac: the books are still in the cloud. %@ is the cloud service's name, or \"the cloud\" when it is unknown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Siguen en %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This EPUB book has no text to read." : {
      "comment" : "Why an EPUB book could not be imported: every chapter in it is blank.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este libro EPUB no tiene texto para leer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Feed Uses Plain http" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the warning shown once after subscribing to a feed whose address uses plain http, which is not encrypted. Title case.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este canal usa http simple"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Feed's Settings" : {
      "comment" : "Heading of the group of settings a feed can have of its own, in Feed Info. Title case.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ajustes de este canal"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Kindle book has no flowing text, as in a comic or print replica, so TextMouth can't read it." : {
      "comment" : "Why a Kindle (KFX) book could not be imported: its pages are fixed layouts or pictures, as in a comic or a print replica, with no text that flows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este libro de Kindle no tiene texto fluido, como un cómic o una réplica impresa, así que TextMouth no puede leerlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Kindle book is compressed in a way TextMouth can't read yet." : {
      "comment" : "Why a Kindle (MOBI) book could not be imported: its text is compressed in a way TextMouth does not read.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este libro de Kindle está comprimido de un modo que TextMouth aún no puede leer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Kindle book is copy-protected, and TextMouth can't read copy-protected books." : {
      "comment" : "Why a Kindle (MOBI) book could not be imported: it is encrypted or carries copy protection (DRM), which TextMouth never removes.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este libro de Kindle tiene protección contra copia, y TextMouth no puede leer libros con protección contra copia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Kindle book is damaged or incomplete. Get a fresh copy, then import it again." : {
      "comment" : "Why a Kindle (MOBI) book could not be imported: it is damaged, and what to do.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este libro de Kindle está dañado o incompleto. Consigue una copia nueva e impórtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Kindle book is damaged or incomplete: %@. Get a fresh copy, then import it again." : {
      "comment" : "Why a Kindle (MOBI) book could not be imported: it is damaged, and what to do. %@ is the reason, a phrase in English that begins with a lowercase letter and has no full stop.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este libro de Kindle está dañado o incompleto: %@. Consigue una copia nueva e impórtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac" : {
      "comment" : "Heading of the report's lines about the device it ran on, on the Mac.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac can't run the speech model that transcription uses." : {
      "comment" : "Error shown when transcription is tried on a Mac whose hardware cannot run the speech model.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta Mac no puede ejecutar el modelo de voz que usa la transcripción."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac doesn't allow TextMouth to use the microphone: a device management profile or Screen Time restricts it." : {
      "comment" : "Error in the Record window when something other than the user, a device management profile or Screen Time, keeps TextMouth from using the microphone.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta Mac no permite que TextMouth use el micrófono: un perfil de administración de dispositivos o Tiempo en pantalla lo restringe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac doesn't know the library's identity, so it can't restore it." : {
      "comment" : "A sentence of why the library can't open: this Mac has no record of the library's identity, so the identity file can't be restored from it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta Mac no conoce la identidad de la biblioteca, así que no puede restaurarla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac is offline, so %@ can't be refreshed. Connect to the internet and try again." : {
      "comment" : "Why a feed could not be refreshed: this Mac has no internet. %@ is the feed's title or server.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta Mac no tiene conexión, así que no se puede actualizar %@. Conéctate a internet e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac is offline, so the book can't be downloaded from %@." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why a book can't be downloaded: the Mac is offline. %@ is the cloud service's name, or \"the cloud service\" when it is unknown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta Mac no tiene conexión, así que el libro no se puede descargar desde %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac is offline, so the directory can't be searched. Connect to the internet and try again." : {
      "comment" : "Why a podcast search failed: this Mac has no internet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta Mac no tiene conexión, así que no se puede buscar en el directorio. Conéctate a internet e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac is offline, so “%@” can't be downloaded. Connect to the internet and try again." : {
      "comment" : "Why a feed item's download failed: this Mac has no internet. %@ is the item's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta Mac no tiene conexión, así que no se puede descargar “%@”. Conéctate a internet e inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac no longer has the chosen table, “%@”; choose another." : {
      "comment" : "Under the pop-ups in the Braille tab of Settings: the chosen braille table of this Mac is gone. %@ is the table's stored name, \"mac:\" and its file name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta Mac ya no tiene la tabla elegida, «%@»; elige otra."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac's braille table “%@” changed from liblouis %@ to %@ since the book was read, so TextMouth keeps the book's text as it was." : {
      "comment" : "Why a book is not read with its braille table again: the table changed. %1$@ is the table's name as macOS gives it, %2$@ the liblouis version the book was read with, and %3$@ the version now.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This Mac's braille table “%1$@” changed from liblouis %2$@ to %3$@ since the book was read, so TextMouth keeps the book's text as it was."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La tabla de braille «%1$@» de esta Mac cambió de liblouis %2$@ a %3$@ desde que se leyó el libro, así que TextMouth conserva el texto del libro tal como estaba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac's braille table “%@” may have changed since liblouis %@ read the book, so TextMouth keeps the book's text as it was." : {
      "comment" : "Why a book is not read with its braille table again: the table may have changed. %1$@ is the table's name as macOS gives it and %2$@ the liblouis version the book was read with.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This Mac's braille table “%1$@” may have changed since liblouis %2$@ read the book, so TextMouth keeps the book's text as it was."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La tabla de braille «%1$@» de esta Mac puede haber cambiado desde que liblouis %2$@ leyó el libro, así que TextMouth conserva el texto del libro tal como estaba."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This PDF needs a password to open." : {
      "comment" : "Why a PDF could not be imported: it is locked with a password TextMouth does not have.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este PDF necesita una contraseña para abrirse."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This SSML file is damaged or incomplete: %@." : {
      "comment" : "Why an SSML (Speech Synthesis Markup Language) file could not be imported: it is damaged. %@ is the reason, a phrase in English that begins with a lowercase letter and has no full stop.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este archivo SSML está dañado o incompleto: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Week" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the Stats pane's tile showing the listening time of this week.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta semana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Window" : {
      "comment" : "A choice of the Open the next book in pop-up button (Settings, Playback; Feed Info; Folder Settings): the next book opens in the window already open, in place of the book there.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta ventana"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This XML file is not a DTBook book, a Word 2003 XML document, or a PEF braille file, the only XML TextMouth reads." : {
      "comment" : "Why an XML file was refused at import: its root element is not one of the three kinds TextMouth reads. DTBook, Word 2003 XML, and PEF are format names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este archivo XML no es un libro DTBook, un documento XML de Word 2003 ni un archivo de braille PEF, los únicos XML que TextMouth lee."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This article has no description." : {
      "comment" : "What Show Description says for an article that has no description.",
