                  "value" : "Este libro conserva su audio original %lld días después de guardarse o editarse por última vez."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This book keeps its original audio until the book is removed." : {
      "comment" : "Said as a book's original audio policy is set to keep the original until the book is removed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este libro conserva su audio original hasta que se quita el libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This book keeps no original audio: saved edits change its audio in place, and can't be undone after." : {
      "comment" : "Said as a book's original audio policy is set to keep no original.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este libro no conserva audio original: las ediciones guardadas cambian su audio directamente y no se pueden deshacer después."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This book was exported from TextMouth as text only." : {
      "comment" : "The first sentence of the accessibility summary written into an exported EPUB.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este libro se exportó desde TextMouth solo como texto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This book was not opened from the reading list." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver announcement when Next in Reading List or Previous in Reading List is used in a reader whose book was not opened from the reading list.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este libro no se abrió desde la lista de lectura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This book was removed from the library, but its bookInfo.json file could not be deleted. It stays out of the library:" : {
      "comment" : "Heading of the error alert's list when Remove from Library Only removed one book but could not delete the bookInfo.json file in its package. bookInfo.json is a file name. The book's title and the reason follow on the next line.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
