            "value" : "Este libro se quitó de la biblioteca, pero no se pudo eliminar su archivo bookInfo.json. Sigue fuera de la biblioteca:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This book's audio could not be converted from Ogg to AAC. TextMouth tries again the next time it starts." : {
      "comment" : "What Play says for a book whose Ogg audio failed to convert at this launch.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo convertir el audio de este libro de Ogg a AAC. TextMouth volverá a intentarlo la próxima vez que se inicie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This book's audio is being converted from Ogg to AAC. It plays when that ends." : {
      "comment" : "What Play says while the book's Ogg audio is being converted to AAC.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El audio de este libro se está convirtiendo de Ogg a AAC. Se reproducirá cuando termine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This book's audio needs converting from Ogg to AAC. TextMouth is converting it now, and it plays when that ends." : {
      "comment" : "What Play says for a book found still in Ogg, whose conversion TextMouth starts.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El audio de este libro necesita convertirse de Ogg a AAC. TextMouth lo está convirtiendo ahora y se reproducirá cuando termine."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This book's only page is %@." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the Go to Page field's hint for a book of one page. %@ is that page's label, an identifier written without digit grouping.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La única página de este libro es %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This book's text can't be read, so it can't be spoken into an audio file." : {
      "comment" : "Shown under the Text as spoken audio checkbox in the Export dialog when the book's text can't be read.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El texto de este libro no se puede leer, así que no se puede convertir en un archivo de audio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This braille looks like English Braille, American Edition. Choose its Braille Code in Book Information." : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. What Book Information says under the pop-up of a braille book that is read as UEB but whose braille shows English Braille, American Edition's signs (BrailleCodeDetector): which code it looks like and where to choose it. Plain, so that VoiceOver and a braille display read it as it is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este braille parece braille inglés, edición estadounidense. Elige su código braille en Información del libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This comic book archive holds more than the %@ pictures TextMouth reads." : {
      "comment" : "Why a comic book archive was refused at import: it holds more pictures than TextMouth reads. %@ is the limit, already formatted.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este archivo de cómic contiene más de las %@ imágenes que TextMouth lee."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This comic book archive holds no pictures TextMouth can read." : {
      "comment" : "Why a comic book archive was refused at import: it holds no picture TextMouth reads.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este archivo de cómic no contiene imágenes que TextMouth pueda leer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This document holds more than %@, the most TextMouth reads from one document." : {
      "comment" : "Why a document could not be imported: it is larger than the most TextMouth reads from one document. %@ is that limit with its unit, such as \"64 MB\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este documento contiene más de %@, el máximo que TextMouth lee de un documento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This document is protected by a password." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why a document could not be imported: it is locked with a password TextMouth does not have.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este documento está protegido con una contraseña."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This download isn't in its feed's folder, so TextMouth left its files as they are." : {
      "comment" : "Why a feed episode's download could not be deleted: it is not in its feed's folder.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta descarga no está en la carpeta de su canal, así que TextMouth dejó sus archivos como están."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This episode has no description." : {
      "comment" : "What Show Description says for an episode that has no description.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este episodio no tiene descripción."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This explanation appears only once." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the Edit Manifest explanation: it is shown only the first time.\nLast sentence of the Edit Text explanation: it is shown only the first time.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta explicación aparece solo una vez."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This feed is no longer in your library." : {
      "comment" : "Feed Info's line for a feed whose record went while the sheet was open.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este canal ya no está en tu biblioteca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This feed needs a password, which TextMouth can't send yet." : {
      "comment" : "Why a feed could not be fetched: the server asks for a password.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este canal necesita una contraseña, que TextMouth todavía no puede enviar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file" : {
      "comment" : "Stands for a file's name at the start of a sentence about refusing it, when no name is known: \"This file is in Ogg, which...\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este archivo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file could not be read as a Word 2003 XML document." : {
      "comment" : "Why a file was refused at import: it could not be read as a Word 2003 XML document. A sentence saying it may be damaged follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo leer este archivo como documento XML de Word 2003."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file could not be read as a Word 97-2003 document." : {
      "comment" : "Why a file was refused at import: it could not be read as a Word 97-2003 (.doc) document. A sentence saying it may be damaged follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo leer este archivo como documento de Word 97-2003."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file could not be read as a comic book archive. It may be damaged, or another kind of file." : {
      "comment" : "Why a file was refused at import: it is no ZIP archive, so it cannot be a comic book archive. Two sentences.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo leer este archivo como archivo de cómic. Puede estar dañado, o ser otro tipo de archivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file could not be read as a picture. It may be damaged, or another kind of file." : {
      "comment" : "Why a file was refused at import: its bytes are no picture at all. Two sentences.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo leer este archivo como imagen. Puede estar dañado, o ser otro tipo de archivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file could not be read as a rich text document with attachments." : {
      "comment" : "Why a file was refused at import: it could not be read as a rich text (RTFD) document with attachments. A sentence saying it may be damaged follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo leer este archivo como documento de texto enriquecido con adjuntos."
          }
        }
