    },
    "This file has no text to read." : {
      "comment" : "Why a text, Markdown, or HTML file was refused at import: it is empty or holds only white space or markup.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este archivo no tiene texto que leer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file holds only part of a Kindle book. Open the book's main .kfx file." : {
      "comment" : "Why a Kindle (KFX) file could not be imported: it is a part of a book, such as the metadata file beside the main file, and what to do. .kfx is a file extension and stays as it is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este archivo contiene solo una parte de un libro de Kindle. Abre el archivo .kfx principal del libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is a Kindle Create package, which TextMouth can't read yet." : {
      "comment" : "Why a file could not be imported: it is a package that Kindle Create writes for an author, which TextMouth does not read yet. Kindle Create is a program's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este archivo es un paquete de Kindle Create, que TextMouth aún no puede leer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is not SSML: it begins with the element “%@”, not “speak”." : {
      "comment" : "Why a file could not be imported as SSML (Speech Synthesis Markup Language): its first element is not speak. %@ is the name of the first element it has. SSML is a format's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este archivo no es SSML: empieza con el elemento “%@”, no con “speak”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is not a Kindle book that TextMouth can read." : {
      "comment" : "Why a file could not be imported as a Kindle (MOBI) book: it is not a Kindle book of a kind TextMouth reads.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este archivo no es un libro de Kindle que TextMouth pueda leer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is not a web archive TextMouth can read. It may be damaged, or another kind of file." : {
      "comment" : "Why a file could not be imported as a web archive (.webarchive, which Safari saves): it does not hold a main page.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este archivo no es un archivo web que TextMouth pueda leer. Puede estar dañado o ser otro tipo de archivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file needs a password, which TextMouth can't send yet." : {
      "comment" : "Why a feed item's download failed: the server asks for a password.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este archivo necesita una contraseña, que TextMouth todavía no puede enviar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file's markup nests more than %@ levels deep, which TextMouth can't read safely." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why a file was refused: its markup has elements inside elements more levels deep than TextMouth reads. %@ is the most levels, a number.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El marcado de este archivo anida más de %@ niveles de profundidad, y TextMouth no puede leerlo de forma segura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file's markup would take TextMouth far too long to read." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why a file was refused: its markup is built so that reading it would take far too long.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Leer el marcado de este archivo le llevaría a TextMouth demasiado tiempo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder has no stored name, so it cannot be changed safely." : {
      "comment" : "Error shown when a folder edit is refused because the folder has no name on record.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta carpeta no tiene un nombre guardado, así que no se puede cambiar de forma segura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder holds another copy of the library TextMouth is using." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of Use This Library's account of the folder the listener chose.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta carpeta contiene otra copia de la biblioteca que usa TextMouth."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder is empty." : {
      "comment" : "The only row of a folder in the iPhone Library that holds no book and no folder.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta carpeta está vacía."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This folder is no longer in the library." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Folder Settings sheet, which shows one library folder's facts and its listening options. What the sheet says in place of the folder, when the folder was deleted in another window while the sheet was open.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta carpeta ya no está en la biblioteca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This iPhone" : {
      "comment" : "Heading of the report's lines about the device it ran on, on the iPhone.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is a temporary library, and library changes are not being saved." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the banner shown at the top of the library while the library index is unreadable.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta es una biblioteca temporal, y los cambios de la biblioteca no se están guardando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is the library TextMouth is using: %@." : {
      "comment" : "Status line when the listener chose the folder that already holds the library in use. %@ is the folder's path.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esta es la biblioteca que usa TextMouth: %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This item could not be deleted and remains in the library:" : {
      "comment" : "Heading over the one item of a folder that could not be deleted permanently. A line about it follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este elemento no se pudo eliminar y permanece en la biblioteca:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This item could not be moved to the Trash and remains in the library:" : {
      "comment" : "Heading over the one item of a folder that could not be moved to the Trash. A line about it follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este elemento no se pudo mover a la Papelera y permanece en la biblioteca:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This item could not be removed from the library and remains in it:" : {
      "comment" : "Heading over the one item of a folder that could not be removed from the library. A line about it follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Este elemento no se pudo quitar de la biblioteca y permanece en ella:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This moves all data from %@ back to the default location, %@." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the question asked before moving the library back to the default location. %1$@ is the current folder's path; %2$@ is the default folder's path.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This moves all data from %1$@ back to the default location, %2$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Esto mueve todos los datos de %1$@ de vuelta a la ubicación predeterminada, %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This picture could not be decoded. It may be damaged." : {
      "comment" : "Why a picture was refused at import: the system could not decode it. Two sentences.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo decodificar esta imagen. Puede estar dañada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This picture holds %lld pages, more than the %@ TextMouth reads." : {
      "comment" : "Why a picture of many pages, such as a TIFF, was refused at import. %1$lld is the number of pages it holds and %2$@ the limit, already formatted.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "This picture holds %lld page, more than the %@ TextMouth reads."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "This picture holds %lld pages, more than the %@ TextMouth reads."
                }
