    "Trim to Selection" : {
      "comment" : "Name of a keyboard shortcut action, listed in Settings in the audio editor group and read by VoiceOver. Deletes all audio outside the selection.\nName of an edit, as the Undo and Redo menu items say it after \"Undo\" or \"Redo\": the audio editor's Trim to Selection, which trims the start and the end together.",
