    "Try Again" : {
      "comment" : "Button of the library index recovery sheet that reads the index file again. Also the name sentences use for it.\nButton of the reader's alert about a chapter that could not be downloaded; it tries the download again.\nButton of the reader's view for a book that could not be got from the cloud; it tries again.\nButton on the Library Not Available screen that checks the library's folder again.",
