    "Unknown" : {
      "comment" : "A voice's quality tier when the system reports one TextMouth does not know, shown beside its name in the voice pickers.\nShown in place of a time (hours, minutes and seconds) that is not a usable number, such as an enormous or missing length.\nThe author shown for a book whose author nothing names, in the library's author column and a book's information.",
