    "Unsubscribed" : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. A condition's relation as its relation pop-up names it, by its test and whether it is negated. This is the form for the first case of the condition.\nThe note after a feed's title while the listener is unsubscribed from it, so TextMouth does not check it. Title case.",
