    "Words per minute" : {
      "comment" : "Label of the voice sheet's speed slider, shown beside it.\nTitle of the default speed slider in the Voice settings.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Palabras por minuto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works in" : {
      "comment" : "Label of the pop-up button in a keyboard shortcut action's row that chooses in which windows the shortcut works, such as every window or Library windows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Funciona en"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Works in %@" : {
      "comment" : "Says where a keyboard shortcut works, in a row of the Shortcuts tab or an announcement. %@ names the windows, such as \"every window\", \"Library windows\", or \"the audio editor\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Funciona en %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes chapter markers and markers beside the audio, in an Audacity label file of the same name." : {
      "comment" : "Hint of the Also write the markers as Audacity labels checkbox. Audacity is the name of an audio editing program.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Escribe las marcas de capítulo y las marcas junto al audio, en un archivo de etiquetas de Audacity con el mismo nombre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes the title, author, publisher, and date into the library's copy of this book." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the hint of the metadata editor's switch that also writes the EPUB file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Escribe el título, el autor, la editorial y la fecha en la copia de la biblioteca de este libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes this and every other too-deeply nested chapter of this export as plain paragraphs of lines, without asking again." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the Export Every Such Chapter as Written button in the alert an export shows when a chapter nests too deeply.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Escribe este y cualquier otro capítulo de esta exportación con anidado demasiado profundo como párrafos simples de líneas, sin volver a preguntar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes this chapter as plain paragraphs of its lines, and exports everything else as usual." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the Export as Written button in the alert an export shows when a chapter nests too deeply.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Escribe este capítulo como párrafos simples con sus líneas y exporta todo lo demás como de costumbre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Year" : {
      "comment" : "Name of the book information sheet's field for an audiobook's year; VoiceOver reads it as the field's label.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Año"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can make a new folder here." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the message of the folder chooser that Change Location opens: the chooser has a button that makes a folder.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Aquí puedes crear una carpeta nueva."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can open and read books, and reading positions are still saved with each book, but changes to the library itself are not saved until you choose one of the options below." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the library index recovery sheet: what still works, and what does not until an option is chosen.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Puedes abrir y leer libros, y las posiciones de lectura se siguen guardando con cada libro, pero los cambios de la propia biblioteca no se guardan hasta que elijas una de las opciones de abajo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can recover it from the Trash until the Trash is emptied." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of the confirmation about the original file of a book just imported, and the hint of its Move to Trash button: the file can be recovered from the Trash.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Puedes recuperarlo de la Papelera hasta que la vacíes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You cleaned it up on %@." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of Book Information's Transcript detail saying when the user cleaned up the transcript. %@ is a date, such as \"October 5, 2026\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Lo limpiaste el %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You cleaned up this transcript on %@. Transcribing again replaces the cleanup." : {
      "comment" : "Line of the Transcribe Audio sheet warning that transcribing again replaces the cleanup the user applied. %@ is a date, such as \"October 5, 2026\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Limpiaste esta transcripción el %@. Volver a transcribir reemplaza la limpieza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You edited it on %@." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of Book Information's Transcript detail saying when the user edited the transcript. %@ is a date, such as \"October 5, 2026\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Lo editaste el %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You edited the transcript on %@, after the cleanup. Undo Cleanup undoes those edits too." : {
      "comment" : "Line of the Clean Up Transcript sheet warning that undoing the cleanup also undoes the user's later edits. %@ is a date, such as \"October 5, 2026\". Undo Cleanup is the name of a button of the sheet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Editaste la transcripción el %@, después de la limpieza. Deshacer limpieza también deshace esas ediciones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You edited this transcript on %@. Transcribing again replaces your edits." : {
      "comment" : "Line of the Transcribe Audio sheet warning that transcribing again replaces the user's own edits. %@ is a date, such as \"October 5, 2026\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Editaste esta transcripción el %@. Volver a transcribir reemplaza tus ediciones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You will be asked whether to delete the original file permanently after each import." : {
      "comment" : "Caption in Storage settings under the choice that asks about the original file after each import, while files are deleted permanently.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se te preguntará si eliminar el archivo original de forma permanente después de cada importación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You will be asked whether to move the original file to the Trash after each import." : {
      "comment" : "Caption in Storage settings under the choice that asks about the original file after each import, while files go to the Trash.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se te preguntará si mover el archivo original a la Papelera después de cada importación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're already subscribed to %@." : {
      "comment" : "Why Subscribe refused: the feed is already in the library. %@ is the feed's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ya tienes una suscripción a %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Mac's library isn't touched." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the message of the iPhone's question before a book is removed: a copy of the book in a Mac's library stays.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca de tu Mac no se toca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your books and reading positions are kept." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the Rebuild Directory confirmation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Tus libros y posiciones de lectura se conservan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your copy of the rules is empty. Edit Rules… opens it to add some." : {
      "comment" : "Line of the Clean Up Transcript sheet when the user's own rules file holds no rule. Edit Rules… is the name of a button of the sheet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Tu copia de las reglas está vacía. Editar reglas… la abre para agregar algunas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your copy of the rules is only in the cloud, so TextMouth asked for it and uses its own meanwhile." : {
      "comment" : "Line of the Clean Up Transcript sheet when the user's own rules file has not been downloaded from the cloud drive yet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Tu copia de las reglas solo está en la nube, así que TextMouth la solicitó y mientras tanto usa las suyas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your edited text was also kept as %@, in the book's package." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence saying where a backup of the user's edited text was kept. %@ is a file name such as content.md.edited-20261004T123012Z, which stays as written.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Tu texto editado también se conservó como %@, en el paquete del libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your edits to the transcript are deleted too." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the question asked before a transcript is deleted, when the user had edited it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Tus ediciones de la transcripción también se eliminan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your edits to the transcript are replaced too." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of the question asked before a transcript from a file replaces the book's, when the user had edited it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Tus ediciones de la transcripción también se reemplazan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your library (%@) will upload to %@ in the background." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of what moving the library into a cloud folder means. %1$@ is the library's size, such as \"5.5 GB\"; %2$@ is the cloud service's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Your library (%1$@) will upload to %2$@ in the background."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Tu biblioteca (%1$@) se subirá a %2$@ en segundo plano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your library is empty. Add to Library adds a book." : {
      "comment" : "The only row of an empty library. \"Add to Library\" is the name of the button that adds a book, so keep it the same as that button's label.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Tu biblioteca está vacía. Agregar a la biblioteca agrega un libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your library will upload to %@ in the background." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of what moving the library into a cloud folder means, when its size is not known. %@ is the cloud service's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Tu biblioteca se subirá a %@ en segundo plano."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your place and bookmarks move with their words." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of what a re-read does to the listener's place and bookmarks.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Tu lugar y tus marcadores se mueven con sus palabras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your rules file can't be used: %@. TextMouth keeps it and a copy, and uses its own rules until you correct it." : {
      "comment" : "Line of the Clean Up Transcript sheet when the user's own rules file is damaged. %@ is the reason, a short technical phrase in English.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se puede usar tu archivo de reglas: %@. TextMouth lo conserva junto con una copia, y usa sus propias reglas hasta que lo corrijas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a book that is not in the library" : {
