      "comment" : "A phrase naming a file Compare Libraries could not read, inside a sentence that starts \"Unread:\". %1$@ is a book's title and %2$@ is a copy of the library.\nA phrase naming a file that could not be read, inside Use This Library's account of why it can't tell which copy is newer. %1$@ is a book's title and %2$@ is a copy of the library.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
